      "text": "This petition has been filed under Section 528 of the BNSS praying for setting aside order dated 09.12.2024 (Annexure P-2) passed by Additional Sessions Judge, SAS Nagar, in case titled as \"State of Punjab vs Bhavjit Gill etc\" bearing case no. SC/34/2021, arising out of FIR No. 208, dated 17.09.2020, registered under sections 302,449,189,149,506,212,419,420,427,460,109,465,4 68,471 and 120- B of IPC and section 25,25,54 and 59 of the Arms Act and Section 12 of the Passports Act Police Station City Kharar, District SAS Nagar, Punjab vide which the Regular Bail granted to the Petitioner by this Court vide Order dated 22.12.2022 (Annexure P-1) has been cancelled, without any cogent reason.\nNone has put in appearance on behalf of the petitioner even on second call.\n1 of 2",
